{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/879196-gifted-second-sight-psycho-kinetics","id":879196,"title":"Gifted & Second Sight Psycho-Kinetics","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-30T19:51:10-07:00","id":879196,"title":"Gifted & Second Sight Psycho-Kinetics","content":"I know of the rules of Freedom as far as New WoD is concerned, but I am curious if it is canon for &quot;Gifted&quot; &amp; Mortal &quot;Psychcis&quot; (&quot;Second Sight&quot;) to be allowed to mix in one lesser template. Are they different or can they be a mix? I hope i am being detailed enough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2097-diana-prince","name":"Diana Prince","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-30T22:44:37-07:00","id":879298,"title":"","content":"For that matter do you out there think &quot;Second Sight&quot; psychic merits can match Witch-Finders splats?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2097-diana-prince","name":"Diana Prince","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-01T05:47:19-07:00","id":879465,"title":"","content":"Does a Gifted/Psychic merit make sense fro an experienced Hunter (Vigil) ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2097-diana-prince","name":"Diana Prince","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-01T06:43:23-07:00","id":879489,"title":"","content":"I am still playing NWoD, not Chronicles yet. Would some out there suggest giving Chronicles a try. Is there a Chronicles, Hunter: Vigil yet?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2097-diana-prince","name":"Diana Prince","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-01T07:51:56-07:00","id":879518,"title":"","content":"In no particular order-<br /> <br /> Hunter second edition is in the works, they've already released a couple of spoilers for it.<br /> <br /> Gifted is not a template, it's a merit, if the ST is cool with it, anyone can buy it.<br /> <br /> In general, most templates can't be mixed. However, there is no rule that you can't be a psychic and a hunter, hunter isn't really a supernatural template in the first place. Both Compacts and Conspiracies and Slashers give the okay for such things (for C&amp;C, it was more geared towards thaumaturges, and Slashers leaves it to the ST as to what happens if Vanguard finds a real psychic,one of the options is that they could keep their psychic powers and still gain access to teleinformics). <br /> <br /> A gifted hunter is fine, if they didn't want it open to hunters they would've made it a dread power or something.<br /> <br /> Also, in chronicles of darkness, psychic powers, so far, have been replaced with supernatural merits which are generally only open to non supernatural characters. Unless hunters actually become a supernatural template in cofd, which I doubt, there will be no issue with a hunter having a psychic ability or two, as long as the ST is okay with it, of course. <br /> <br /> As for psychics standing up to a witch from witchfinders, no, in general the psychic will be overmatched, the psychic merits aren't that impressive, really. Ditto the gifted if that's what you meant, but since gifted isn't a template, nothing stops one from allowing psychic characters to buy gifted abilities. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-01T09:10:46-07:00","id":879547,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/879196-gifted-second-sight-psycho-kinetics?p=879518#post879518\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> In no particular order-<br /> <br /> Hunter second edition is in the works, they've already released a couple of spoilers for it.<br /> <br /> Gifted is not a template, it's a merit, if the ST is cool with it, anyone can buy it.<br /> <br /> In general, most templates can't be mixed. However, there is no rule that you can't be a psychic and a hunter, hunter isn't really a supernatural template in the first place. Both Compacts and Conspiracies and Slashers give the okay for such things (for C&amp;C, it was more geared towards thaumaturges, and Slashers leaves it to the ST as to what happens if Vanguard finds a real psychic,one of the options is that they could keep their psychic powers and still gain access to teleinformics).<br /> <br /> A gifted hunter is fine, if they didn't want it open to hunters they would've made it a dread power or something.<br /> <br /> Also, in chronicles of darkness, psychic powers, so far, have been replaced with supernatural merits which are generally only open to non supernatural characters. Unless hunters actually become a supernatural template in cofd, which I doubt, there will be no issue with a hunter having a psychic ability or two, as long as the ST is okay with it, of course.<br /> <br /> As for psychics standing up to a witch from witchfinders, no, in general the psychic will be overmatched, the psychic merits aren't that impressive, really. Ditto the gifted if that's what you meant, but since gifted isn't a template, nothing stops one from allowing psychic characters to buy gifted abilities.</div> </div> </div> </div> <br /> \u200bThank You, so much. This helps.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2097-diana-prince","name":"Diana Prince","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}